lass=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li></ul></div>\n</div></section></section>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section></aside>\n<b>Stuffed Bear</b> is a taxidermied bear. \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>The Stuffed Bear is found in several places.\n</p>\n<ul><li>At the <a href=\"/wiki/Apothecary%27s_Cellar\" title=\"Apothecary's Cellar\">Apothecary's Cellar</a></li>\n<li>At the <a href=\"/wiki/Durinbold_Mausoleum\" title=\"Durinbold Mausoleum\">Durinbold Mausoleum</a></li>\n<li>At the <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Rock_Fortress\" title=\"Wyrm's Rock Fortress\">Wyrm's Rock Fortress</a></li></ul>\n<p>A named stuffed bear called <a href=\"/wiki/Darkmaw_the_Wicked\" title=\"Darkmaw the Wicked\">Darkmaw the Wicked</a> is in <a href=\"/wiki/Last_Light_Inn\" title=\"Last Light Inn\">Last Light Inn</a>.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714234528\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.091 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.093 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3627/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33697/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 15273/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 15/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5641/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.020/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 948634/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   89.725      1 -total\n 99.08%   88.903      1 Template:Infobox_creature\n 64.70%   58.055      1 Template:Infobox_creature/internal\n 26.99%   24.221      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 11.74%   10.538      1 Template:Template_style\n  6.85%    6.148     52 Template:Plus_if_pos\n  4.46%    4.002      2 Template:Credits\n  3.79%    3.398      5 Template:Resistance\n  2.73%    2.451     15 Template:Trim\n  1.20%